---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Business Development Consultancy" description="Market intelligence and commercial strategy for shipyards, owners and operators." nav="services" page="service-business-development" mainClass="svc-detail">

  <section class="hero page ph-service sd-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap sd-grid">
      <div class="rise">
        <span class="tag">Service 8 of 8</span>
        <h1>Business Development Consultancy</h1>
        <p class="sub">Market intelligence and commercial strategy for shipyards, owners and operators.</p>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <div class="wrap sd-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs"><a href="/services/">← All services</a><span>/</span><b>Business Development Consultancy</b></nav>
      <p class="sd-lead">Navigating maritime markets: precision business development for marine and maritime services</p>
      <div class="sd-top reveal">
        <figure class="sd-pic plate">
          <img src="/images/svc-bizdev-hands.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 50%" alt="Business Development Consultancy">
          
        </figure>
        <section class="sd-block first">
          <h4><span>1</span>What we do</h4>
          <p>We accelerate growth for marine and maritime service providers. We connect technical expertise, offshore capabilities and port services with global vessel operators, shipyards and energy majors to secure long-term contracts and expand market share. We provide comprehensive business development, market intelligence and commercial strategy consultancy tailored exclusively for shipyards, shipowners and ship operators. By bridging technical expertise with commercial strategy, we help maritime stakeholders secure new contracts, optimize existing assets and successfully navigate complex market shifts. Whether you are looking to fill your shipyard&#39;s order book, expand your operating fleet or diversify into high-growth marine sectors, we deliver the actionable data and strategic industry connections required to accelerate your commercial expansion.</p>
          
        </section>
      </div>
      
      <nav class="sd-pn">
        <a href="/services/welding/"><span class="k">← Previous</span><span class="t">Marine &amp; Industry Welder and Welding Qualification Advisory</span></a>
        <a class="sd-all btn dark plate" href="/services/">All services</a>
        <span></span>
      </nav>
      <div class="sd-talk plate reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Talk to our team</span>
        <h3>Interested in Business Development Consultancy?</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your vessel or project and we'll come back with a clear plan.</p>
        <a class="btn plate" href="/contact/">Enquire now <span class="ar">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
